+/* Constant Descriptions:
+ * 0.145898    : (~0.382) ^2
+ * 0.8541      : 1.0 -(~0.382) ^2
+ * 0.0638587   : (RGB Euclidean distance scaled by ~0.382 twice) ^2
+ * 0.75        : (RGB Euclidean distance scaled by  0.500) ^2
